  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monze Womens Cooking Oil Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture (oil-seeds)..Beneficiaries: Farmers..Location: Monze, Southern Province..Summary: USADF is supporting the Monze Women Development Association to expand its cooking oil enterprise. Using grant funds the association will build the capacity of its board and farmers, as well as purchase of equipment to enable an efficient and sustainable cooking oil business.</narrative>
  </description>
